99
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:32,000
Just like cell phone frequencies are auctioned off.

100
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:36,000
And they're auctioned off to the highest, usually to the highest bidder.

101
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:40,000
And some radio stations are paying up to 10 million euros.

